# Launch checklist

Tick each item. The count and the percentage follow your boxes. Trust this document to turn the boxes on.

:state design = false
:state copy = false
:state review = false
:state ship = false

:checkbox design
- Design approved

:checkbox copy
- Copy written

:checkbox review
- Review done

:checkbox ship
- Shipped

:computed left = 4 - design - copy - review - ship
:computed percent = (4 - left) * 25

Left to do: { left } of 4. Progress: { percent }%.

Ticks are temporary preview state. Saving the document saves the source, not your ticks.
